<title>AUSTRALIA: Wesfarmers says confident on year profit.</title>
<headline>Wesfarmers says confident on year profit.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Western Australia-based pastoral and energy house Wesfarmers Ltd said on Tuesday it remained positive about its profit outlook for the 1996/97 year ending June 30 after reporting a 50.5 percent rise in net profit for the nine months to March.</p>
</text>
